flowchart TD
    start([New run]) --> fetch[Fetch Jira ticket through configured integration]
    fetch -->|Ticket retrieved| plan[Agent creates a structured implementation plan]
    fetch -->|Confirmed not found| notFound([Stop: ticket not found])
    fetch -->|Integration, access, or temporary failure| failed[Record an accurate stage error]

    plan --> planApproval{Plan decision}
    planApproval -->|Revise with feedback| plan
    planApproval -->|Reject| rejected([Stop: plan rejected])
    planApproval -->|Approve| branch[Create or reuse isolated ticket branch]

    branch --> implement[Agent implements the approved plan]
    implement --> validate[Run configured project validation]
    validate -->|Checks failed| validationFailed([Stop: validation failed])
    validate -->|No run-owned changes| noChanges([Stop: nothing to publish])
    validate -->|Passed with changes| publishApproval{Publication decision}

    publishApproval -->|Reject| pushRejected([Stop: publication rejected])
    publishApproval -->|Approve selected paths| publish[Commit selected paths, push branch, create draft PR]
    publish --> done([Draft PR published])

    stageFailure[Plan, implementation, validation,<br/>or publication tool failure] -.-> failed
    failed --> retryChoice{Retry available?}
    retryChoice -->|No| errorStop([Stop: action required])
    retryChoice -->|Yes| retry[Resume the recorded failed stage]

    classDef action fill:#e8f0fe,stroke:#3667a6,color:#152033;
    classDef decision fill:#fff4cc,stroke:#a46f00,color:#332500;
    classDef success fill:#e4f6e9,stroke:#2f7d44,color:#12351c;
    classDef stop fill:#f8e7e7,stroke:#a33d3d,color:#421919;
    class fetch,plan,branch,implement,validate,publish,failed,retry action;
    class planApproval,publishApproval,retryChoice decision;
    class done success;
    class notFound,errorStop,rejected,validationFailed,noChanges,pushRejected stop;
